### ls output sent to a file and a pipe
ls > listing.txt | grep conf
>>> SC2010 1:1
>>> SC2260 1:4

### explicit fd 1 redirect before the pipe
du -sh /home 1> usage.txt | sort -h
>>> SC2260 1:15

### pipe-ampersand carries stderr onward
ls > out.log 2> err.log |& grep "No space left"
>>> SC2010 1:1

### output process substitution may still write
tar cf - src > >(gzip > src.tgz) | wc -c
>>> none

### stderr only redirected before the pipe
make 2> build.err | tee build.log
>>> none
